#. う～ん…
msgctxt "0001 | CHIHIRO FUJISAKI"
msgid "No..."
msgstr ""

#. うう～ん……
msgctxt "0002 | CHIHIRO FUJISAKI"
msgid "No...!"
msgstr ""

#. …不二咲さん、どうかしたの？
msgctxt "0003 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "What's wrong, Chihiro?"
msgstr ""

#. なんか…痛くなってきちゃって…
msgctxt "0004 | CHIHIRO FUJISAKI"
msgid "Ahh, it hurts..."
msgstr ""

#. え？　怪我でもしたの？
msgctxt "0005 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Huh? Did you get hurt, Chihiro?"
msgstr ""

#. ううん、そうじゃなくって…
msgctxt "0006 | CHIHIRO FUJISAKI"
msgid "Oh, well...not really."
msgstr ""

#. 昨日の夜、<CLT 3>蚊に刺された<CLT>みたいで…
msgctxt "0007 | CHIHIRO FUJISAKI"
msgid "I <CLT 3>got bit by a mosquito<CLT> last night."
msgstr ""

#. 蚊に…？
msgctxt "0008 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "A mosquito...?"
msgstr ""

#. な、なんだ…そっか…
#. 痛いって言うから、怪我でもしたのかと…
msgctxt "0009 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"Oh, I figured something serious had happened, since\n"
"you were saying how it hurt."
msgstr ""

#. あ、勘違いさせちゃった…？
msgctxt "0010 | CHIHIRO FUJISAKI"
msgid "Oh, did I give you the wrong impression...?"
msgstr ""

#. ご、ごめんなさい…！
msgctxt "0011 | CHIHIRO FUJISAKI"
msgid "S-Sorry...!"
msgstr ""

#. ううん、謝らないでよ。
#. ボクが勝手に勘違いしただけだからさ…
msgctxt "0012 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "You don't have to apologize. It was my own fault."
msgstr ""

#. でも、痛くなってきたって…
#. そんなに刺されたの？
msgctxt "0013 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"But you said it hurts? Did it really bite\n"
"you that hard?"
msgstr ""

#. うん、そうなんだ…
#. 見てよ…
msgctxt "0014 | CHIHIRO FUJISAKI"
msgid "Yeah, see? Look."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>そう言って、差し出した彼女の白い腕には、
#. 大きく赤く腫れあがった痕があった…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0015 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>She held out her arm. The huge red bump stood out\n"
"clearly against her pale skin.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. うわ、こんなに？
msgctxt "0016 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Holy cow!"
msgstr ""

#. かゆいの通り越して…
#. なんだか痛くなってきちゃって…
msgctxt "0017 | CHIHIRO FUJISAKI"
msgid "It's way past itchy now. It really hurts...!"
msgstr ""

#. でも、こんな腫れるほど刺されたなんて…
#. 寝てる間に刺されたのかな？
msgctxt "0018 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"But why's it so big? Did it bite you while you were\n"
"sleeping or something?"
msgstr ""

#. …ううん、起きてたよ。
msgctxt "0019 | CHIHIRO FUJISAKI"
msgid "Oh, no. I was awake."
msgstr ""

#. え？　起きてたのに気付かなかったの？
msgctxt "0020 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "But you didn't notice?"
msgstr ""

#. えっと…気付いてはいたんだけど…
msgctxt "0021 | CHIHIRO FUJISAKI"
msgid "No, I noticed. But..."
msgstr ""

#. え？
msgctxt "0022 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "But what?"
msgstr ""

#. 昨日の夜ね、ふと見たら、
#. 腕に蚊が止まってて…
msgctxt "0023 | CHIHIRO FUJISAKI"
msgid "Well, I felt it bite me, and I looked down at it."
msgstr ""

#. そのままにしてたら、
#. 血をいっぱい吸われちゃったんだ…
msgctxt "0024 | CHIHIRO FUJISAKI"
msgid ""
"But I didn't do anything. I just sat there and watched\n"
"it suck my blood..."
msgstr ""

#. …見てたの？　叩かないで？
msgctxt "0025 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "You just watched? Why didn't you smack it?"
msgstr ""

#. だって、叩いちゃったら死んじゃうでしょ？
msgctxt "0026 | CHIHIRO FUJISAKI"
msgid "Cuz...that would've killed it, right?"
msgstr ""

#. そりゃ…死んじゃうだろうけど…
msgctxt "0027 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Well yeah, but..."
msgstr ""

#. きっとお腹がすいてたんだよ。
#. だから、あんなにたくさん血を吸ったんだと思うよ…
msgctxt "0028 | CHIHIRO FUJISAKI"
msgid ""
"It must have been really hungry to suck that much\n"
"blood."
msgstr ""

#. そんなにお腹をすかせてるのに…
#. 何もあげないのは可哀相だから…
msgctxt "0029 | CHIHIRO FUJISAKI"
msgid ""
"If it was that hungry, it would've been really sad not\n"
"to let it have anything."
msgstr ""

#. …蚊だよ？
msgctxt "0030 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "But...it's just a mosquito."
msgstr ""

#. でも、蚊だって生きてるし…
#. それに…家族だっているかもしれないし…
msgctxt "0031 | CHIHIRO FUJISAKI"
msgid ""
"Mosquitos are living things too, though. It might have\n"
"its own mosquito family..."
msgstr ""

#. ご、ごめんなさい…
msgctxt "0032 | CHIHIRO FUJISAKI"
msgid "S-Sorry, I know that's dumb..."
msgstr ""

#. いや、謝る事じゃないって言うか…
msgctxt "0033 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "No, really, you don't have to apologize."
msgstr ""

#. とにかく、かいたりしない方がいいよ。
#. もっと酷くなっちゃうから…
msgctxt "0034 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"But don't go scratching it, okay? That'll just make\n"
"things worse."
msgstr ""

#. でも…どうしても、かゆくなっちゃったら？
msgctxt "0035 | CHIHIRO FUJISAKI"
msgid "But what if it gets so itchy I can't take it?"
msgstr ""

#. そういう時はさ、
#. 爪でバッテン付ければ多少は収まるよ。
msgctxt "0036 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"Well...in that case, just take the tip of your\n"
"fingernail and push it into the bump. That'll help."
msgstr ""

#. へぇ…そうなんだ…
msgctxt "0037 | CHIHIRO FUJISAKI"
msgid "Wow, I had no idea...!"
msgstr ""

#. すごいね！　苗木君は物知りなんだね！
msgctxt "0038 | CHIHIRO FUJISAKI"
msgid "You're so smart, Makoto!"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>この展開で、この小動物的な笑顔…
#. きっと狙ってないんだろうけど…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0039 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>As she said that, she smiled like a tiny, cute little\n"
"animal. I wonder if she does that on purpose...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>だとしたら…
#. 尚更、恐ろしいな。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0040 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>If so, that's a whole other level of scary.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. それにしても…
#. なんだか不思議だよねぇ？
msgctxt "0041 | CHIHIRO FUJISAKI"
msgid "But anyway, don't you think it's kinda strange?"
msgstr ""

#. …え、不思議って？
msgctxt "0042 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Huh? What is?"
msgstr ""

#. だって、この学園は密閉されてるんだよ？
#. 蚊なんて、どこから入って来たんだろう…
msgctxt "0043 | CHIHIRO FUJISAKI"
msgid ""
"Well this school is completely sealed off, right?\n"
"So how'd a mosquito get in?"
msgstr ""

#. もしかして、この学園の中に、
#. 虫が生きられる自然でもあるのかなぁ…
msgctxt "0044 | CHIHIRO FUJISAKI"
msgid ""
"Maybe there's somewhere here in the school where bugs\n"
"can live and grow. Some kind of...nature-y spot."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>この学園の中に自然が…？
#. まぁ、ないとは言い切れないかもしれないけど…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0045 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>A \"nature-y\" place in the school...? Well, I can't say\n"
"for sure that there's not.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. それかさぁ！　外に繋がる秘密の抜け穴でも、
#. 存在するのかもしれないよね！？
msgctxt "0046 | CHIHIRO FUJISAKI"
msgid ""
"Or or or! Maybe there's a secret passage somewhere\n"
"that leads out of the school!"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>抜け穴…か…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0047 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>A secret passage...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. なんにしても、きっと出られるはずだよ。
msgctxt "0048 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"Well, even if there's not, I'm sure we'll get out of\n"
"here somehow."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 3>みんなで協力<CLT>すれば、
#. きっと、すぐに出られるはずだよ。
msgctxt "0049 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"As long as <CLT 3>we all work together<CLT>, I'm sure we'll be\n"
"out of here in no time!"
msgstr ""

#. そうだね、やっぱり協力は大事だよね…
msgctxt "0050 | CHIHIRO FUJISAKI"
msgid "You're right! Working together is super important..."
msgstr ""

#. …と言っても、足を引っ張るばっかりで、
#. あんまり役に立てないかもしれないけど…
msgctxt "0051 | CHIHIRO FUJISAKI"
msgid ""
"Of course, I dunno how I can be useful. I'll probably\n"
"just weigh you all down..."
msgstr ""

#. …そんな事ないよ。
#. 不二咲さんが協力してくれるのは心強いって！
msgctxt "0052 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"That's not true! It makes me feel way better knowing\n"
"you're here to help!"
msgstr ""

#. …心強い？　ホントに？
msgctxt "0053 | CHIHIRO FUJISAKI"
msgid "It does? Really...?"
msgstr ""

#. だから、一緒に頑張ろうね。
msgctxt "0054 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Yup! So let's all do our best, okay?"
msgstr ""

#. う、うん…！
msgctxt "0055 | CHIHIRO FUJISAKI"
msgid "O-Okay!"
msgstr ""

#. えへへ…
#. ありがとね、苗木君…
msgctxt "0056 | CHIHIRO FUJISAKI"
msgid "Eheh... Thank you, Makoto."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 23>不二咲千尋の<CLT><CLT 3>通信簿<CLT><CLT 23>に、今の情報を追記致しました。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0057 | NARRATION"
msgid ""
"<CLT 23>Chihiro's <CLT><CLT 3>Report Card<CLT><CLT 23> has been updated based on your\n"
"experience with her.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 23>おめでとうございます。
#. <CLT><CLT 3>“スキルポイント”<CLT><CLT 23>が上がりました。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0058 | NARRATION"
msgid ""
"<CLT 23>Your maximum number of <CLT><CLT 3>Skill Points<CLT><CLT 23> has increased!\n"
"Hey, look at you go!\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>不二咲さんと別れた後、
#. ボクはいったん、自分の部屋に戻る事にした。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0059 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Once we were all done, I headed back to my room for a\n"
"little while...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
